{"id":"unglu_ck","lemma":"Unglück","pos":"noun","rank":2007,"glosses":["unhappiness; sorrow","bad luck; misfortune","accident, calamity, catastrophe"],"ipa":"/ˈʊnˌɡlʏk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fb/De-Ungl%C3%BCck.ogg/De-Ungl%C3%BCck.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Unglückes","plural":"Unglücke"},"examples":[{"text":"Das Unglück ist vor zwei Stunden passiert.","en":"The accident happened two hours ago.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"two (numerical value…"},{"g":"to defer (due date"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"}]},{"text":"Er hatte das Unglück, seinen Sohn zu verlieren.","en":"He had the misfortune to lose his son.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"son"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to lose"}]},{"text":"Ein zerbrochener Spiegel bringt Unglück.","en":"A broken mirror brings bad luck.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"mirror"},{"g":"to bring","l":"bringen"},null]},{"text":"Ein Unglück kommt selten allein.","en":"When it rains, it pours.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"seldom"},{"g":"alone"}]},{"text":"Schwarze Katzen bringen Unglück.","en":"Black cats are bad luck.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759746","words":[{"g":"a black object or being","l":"Schwarzer"},{"g":"house cat","l":"Katze"},{"g":"to bring"},null]}]}